flowchart TD

    %% =========================
    %% Main Extraction Process
    %% =========================
    A([Start]) --> B[Extractor]
    B --> C[Extract Data from System A]
    C --> D{Is Date <br/> August 21, 2026?}

    %% Legacy Flow
    D -- Yes --> E[Read Data from<br/>Policy Data S3 Bucket]
    E --> F[Get Data from CDA]
    F --> G[Convert Data into<br/>Earnix Format]
    G --> H[Supplement Missing Data<br/>from CDA Source]
    H --> I[Convert Data into<br/>Target System Format<br/><br/>True → Y<br/>False → F<br/>etc.]
    I --> J[Write Data to<br/>AP Data Mart]

    %% New Event Driven Flow
    D -- No --> K[Read Events from<br/>Premium Data Events]
    K --> J

    %% =========================
    %% Monthly Batch Process
    %% =========================
    J --> L[(AP Data Mart)]

    M([Batch Process]) --> N[Read Data from<br/>AP Data Mart]
    N --> O[Monthly Processing]
    O --> P[Create AP File]
    P --> Q([End])
